earthview-wallpaper (2.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Multi-source wallpaper engine with a plugin architecture.
  * New sources: NASA EPIC, Himawari-8, GOES, NASA APOD, Unsplash.
  * Themed collections, favourites, history, and wallpaper timer.
  * Time-aware mode and fly-over routes.
  * GTK preferences dialog.

